{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026kX4Ah4sVmY1794967884.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>今日天氣提提你：</p><p></p><p>位於廣東內陸的一道冷鋒及其相關的雲帶正逐漸向南移動，預料該冷鋒會在今日稍後橫過沿岸地區。<br/><br/>本港地區今日天氣預測:<br/>部分時間有陽光。初時吹微風，下午雲量增多及有一兩陣雨，北風逐漸增強。晚上市區氣溫下降至最低約21度，新界再低兩三度。<br/><br/>展望: 未來一兩日大致多雲，天氣顯著轉涼，星期五及星期六市區最低氣溫在15、16度左右，新界再低兩三度。</p><p></p><p>今日天氣預告由專治屙嘔肚痛嘅李萬山脾胃丸帶俾你。</p><p></p><p>09:45 更新</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T02:44:33.511763+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":211,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T21:50:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T22:57:35.088901+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T02:37:39.047155+00:00","content_hash":"6c7ccadacb7f5b24da5ea5b563a55dd20cc9f9d8fc4aae455dbb751372a5efd2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T02:44:33.511763+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}